[{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32800100_03_0000","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32800100_03_0010","text":"早上好———"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32800100_03_0020","text":"嘶……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32800100_03_0030","text":"路加酱，早上好\n来得真早啊……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32800100_03_0031","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32800100_03_0040","text":"我想在排练之前\n多少再练一会儿……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32800100_03_0050","text":"那个……就是，还差得远呢……\n我会加油的……所以别一直盯着我看啦……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32800100_03_0060","text":"说什么呢……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32800100_03_0061","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32800100_03_0070","text":"跳得烂也好，怎么样也好，\n你已经是站在台上被人看的立场了吧……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32800100_03_0080","text":"…………\n也是呢……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32800100_03_0090","text":"就算难看，我也会……\n全力以赴的……！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32800100_03_0091","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32800100_03_0100","text":"请多关照——……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32800100_03_0101","text":"Motion"}]
